  "slug": "cucumber-and-garlic-yogurt-dip",
  "title": "Cucumber and Garlic Yogurt Dip",
  "blurb": "A cool, creamy dip with grated cucumber and garlic stirred through thick yogurt, sharpened with vinegar and finished with olive oil.",
  "steps": [
    "Peel the cucumber, cut it in half lengthways and scoop out the seeds with a teaspoon.",
    "Grate the cucumber flesh coarsely, then squeeze it firmly in your hands over the sink to remove as much liquid as possible.",
    "Peel and crush the garlic cloves to a paste.",
    "Put the yogurt in a bowl and stir in the grated cucumber, garlic, vinegar, olive oil and salt until evenly combined.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning if needed, then serve straight away or chill until ready to use."
